// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO4/39 - internal power-gates for the onboard
// NeoPixel matrix and single NeoPixel, not general-purpose.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO21 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed onboard 5x5 RGB
// NeoPixel matrix data pin (NEOPIXEL_MATRIX_DATA) per circuitpython.org and
// espboards.dev FeatherS2 Neo pinout pages.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO40 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed onboard single
// NeoPixel RGB LED data pin (NEOPIXEL_DATA, power-gated by excluded GPIO39)
// per Adafruit product page (adafruit.com/product/5629) and
// circuitpython.org FeatherS2 Neo pinout page.
